# Student Learning Experience: Enrollment & Course Player

This plan outlines the implementation of the core student learning journey, enabling users to enroll in courses, access high-end learning interfaces, and track their progress.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Enrollment Logic**: Currently, we use an `Orders` module. We need to decide if "enrollment" is granted immediately upon order creation (for free/testing) or only after payment.
> - **Course Player Layout**: The course player will be a specialized UI (sidebar for curriculum, main area for content).

## Proposed Changes

### [Backend] [Orders & Enrollment]

#### [MODIFY] [OrderController.php](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Orders/app/Http/Controllers/OrderController.php)
- Implement a `quickEnroll` method for free courses or testing.
- Ensure `payment_status` updates trigger enrollment permissions.

#### [NEW] [Enrollment Middleware](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/app/Http/Middleware/CheckEnrollment.php)
- Middleware to ensure a student is enrolled in a course before accessing its lessons.

---

### [Frontend] [Course Catalog & Dashboard]

#### [MODIFY] [CourseCatalog (page.tsx)](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-frontend/src/app/(dashboard)/courses/page.tsx)
- Replace mock data with real API calls to `GET /api/courses`.
- Add an "Enroll Now" or "View Course" button with real logic.

#### [NEW] [My Learning (page.tsx)](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-frontend/src/app/(dashboard)/dashboard/page.tsx)
- Update the main dashboard to show enrolled courses and progress bars.

---

### [Frontend] [Course Player]

#### [NEW] [CoursePlayer ([id]/learn/page.tsx)](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-frontend/src/app/(dashboard)/courses/[id]/learn/page.tsx)
- Implement the specialized course player UI.
- Video/PDF/Text rendering based on lesson type.
- "Mark as Completed" button integrated with [Progress](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Progress/app/Http/Controllers/ProgressController.php#11-68) API.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Test enrollment API with various user roles.
- Verify progress tracking increments correctly via Postman/Manual tests.

### Manual Verification
- Enroll in a course as a student.
- Navigate to the course player.
- Complete a lesson and verify the progress bar updates on the dashboard.
